{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-designer-layout-tsx","path":"/designers/saint/","result":{"data":{"strapiDesigner":{"id":"170eb6ed-21c2-571f-9b29-e8ef5cebc200","strapi_id":38,"ShortDescription":"SAINT Bridal Couture brings together refined luxury and poetic romance – crafted for brides who want a gown unlike any other.","PriceRangeLow":"300000","PriceRangeHigh":"495000","Name":"SAINT","LongDescription":[{"children":[{"text":"SAINT is born from founder Michele Corty’s French roots and the timeless charm of Saint-Germain-des-Prés in Paris. Saint leans into quiet luxury, refined elegance, and effortless romance. "}]},{"children":[{"text":"SAINT brings elevated design, versatility, thoughtful silhouettes, mix-and-match elements, and unexpected details to brides across a range of styles. SAINT’s intentions are to push boundaries, challenge expectations, and bring modern bridal fashion to life – and we are so here for it. "}]},{"children":[{"text":""}]}],"ImageDesktop":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#d8c8c8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/a35f31117cacaaf8df3c1750b5490deb/e7675/saint_desktop_c60e7b116f.jpg","srcSet":"/static/a35f31117cacaaf8df3c1750b5490deb/0f250/saint_desktop_c60e7b116f.jpg 179w,\n/static/a35f31117cacaaf8df3c1750b5490deb/e957c/saint_desktop_c60e7b116f.jpg 357w,\n/static/a35f31117cacaaf8df3c1750b5490deb/e7675/saint_desktop_c60e7b116f.jpg 714w","sizes":"(min-width: 714px) 714px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/a35f31117cacaaf8df3c1750b5490deb/c856b/saint_desktop_c60e7b116f.webp 179w,\n/static/a35f31117cacaaf8df3c1750b5490deb/2cfc8/saint_desktop_c60e7b116f.webp 357w,\n/static/a35f31117cacaaf8df3c1750b5490deb/0374f/saint_desktop_c60e7b116f.webp 714w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 714px) 714px, 100vw"}]},"width":1440,"height":994.2857142857143}}}}],"ImageMobile":{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#d8c8